OL,3,AInternet restricted after fighting
OL,4,Abreaks out in Ethiopia's Tigray region
OL,5,
OL,6,FInternet and call services have been
OL,7,Fdisrupted in Ethiopia's northern region
OL,8,Fof Tigray following the outbreak of
OL,9,Ffighting this week between regional
OL,10,Fforces and the national army.
OL,12,FServices provided by state-owned
OL,13,Ftelecoms operator Ethio Telecom have
OL,14,Fbeen completely cut, although those
OL,15,Ffrom the smaller private firm Safaricom
OL,16,Fremain operational. Internet monitoring
OL,17,Fgroup NetBlocks earlier posted on X
OL,18,Fthat network data indicated a
OL,19,Fsub-national internet shutdown in
OL,20,Fnorthern Tigray.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
